# T1-style hop: sounding rocket to 20 km and back under the chute.
launch sounding Hopper
view zoom 30
shot pad
tap throttle_full
stage
until alt > 300 timeout 30
view zoom 10
shot launch
until alt > 20000 timeout 120
expect vspeed > 0
until vspeed < 0 timeout 300
tap throttle_cut
log apex
until alt < 4000 timeout 900
until speed < 135 timeout 300
tap chutes
until landed == 1 timeout 900
expect landed == 1 and parts >= 5
view zoom 12
shot landed
end
